### 1. GoLang (`agent-uri-sdk-go`)

The Go SDK provides a comprehensive package for resolving and fetching AGENTCHAIN resources.

#### Installation

```bash
go get github.com/AGENTCHAIN/agent-uri-sdk-go # Replace with actual repository path
```

#### Core Functionality

