## Error Handling

Each SDK version provides a custom error type (e.g., `client.ErrResourceNotFound` in Go, `agentClientError` in Python and JS/TS) that is raised/returned for various issues, including URI parsing failures, DHT lookup errors, dev connection problems, or if the resource cannot be fetched. Always handle potential errors when calling SDK functions.

